            <ArticleTitle>Coiling of a vulvar arterio-venous malformation.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1136/bcr.03.2011.3972</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">bcr0320113972</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors report the case of a 13-year-old girl with a painful vulvar swelling and abnormal vaginal bleeding, increasing in size after trauma. With MRI (GE Signa HDx 1.5 Tesla), it is diagnosed as an arterio-venous malformation arising from the left superior femoral artery. It is treated by embolisation using a coil.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
